Third-Party Data Attribution Notice:
  - A subset of training-only rows in `train_24k.parquet` (flagged with `is_external_train_only = 1`;
    1,600 original English Fear tweets plus 1,147 derived Fear paraphrases) incorporates or derives
    from the CARER / DAIR-AI Emotion dataset:
      E. Saravia et al., "CARER: Contextualized Affect Representations for Emotion Recognition,"
      Proc. EMNLP 2018, pp. 3687-3697.
  - Users requiring strictly AffectFusion-native freshly collected samples may filter directly on
    `is_external_train_only == 0`. Validation (`val_3k`) and Test (`test_3k`) splits contain 0
    external and 0 augmented records.
